    "startPc": "00C01A56",
    "observation": "The scalar diagnostic starts at the same PC/cycle as the native field-7320 capture. On line 255 the Copper reaches the final wait; at line 256 the old implementation reloads BPL1 to $2A72E, duplicating the upper scene. No guest memory is patched."
  },
